      "img": "icons/creatures/slimes/slime-movement-pseudopod-green.webp",
      "system": {
        "active": true,
        "description": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Trigger:</em> While the black pudding is Large or Medium and has 10+ Hit Points, it becomes Bloodied or is subjected to Lightning or Slashing damage. <em>Response:</em> The black pudding splits into two new <strong>Black Pudding</strong>. Each new black pudding is one size smaller than the original black pudding and acts on its Initiative. The original black pudding's Hit Points are divided evenly between the new black puddings (round down).</p>",
